      "content": "These are a great start for the vibe, but for the image generator, we need much more specific visual detail. The AI needs to know exactly what these people look like to get the lighting and skin tones right. Can you expand on the first two descriptions? Give me detailed physical descriptions for the CEO, the artist, the philanthropist, and the tech genius—include their facial features, skin tones, and hair textures to really capture that high-end, polished aesthetic.",
